    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d582">

                <pb facs="0812" n="710" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg710"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/3082: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Ethiopia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Engert</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Addis Ababa</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-12-16T14:00:00+02:35">December 16,
                            1935—2 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 2:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>235. My 225, December 13, noon. Emperor has declined to accept Anglo-French
                    proposals or even to discuss them as a possible basis of negotiations.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Engert</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
